---
layout: base.njk
title: Partners
permalink: partners.html
hero_title: Our Partners
hero_subtitle: Vintage Politics is made possible through the support of esteemed
  partners who share our commitment to quality conversation.
partners:
  - name: Corney & Barrow
    image: https://www.corneyandbarrow.com/media/wysiwyg/c_b_delivery_and_returns_policy.jpg
    url: https://www.corneyandbarrow.com/
    description: Proud partners for Series Two, providing exceptional wine curation.
  - name: ETO
    image: https://www.etowine.com/cdn/shop/files/The_perfect_gift_mkII.jpg
    url: https://www.etowine.com/
    description: Innovative wine preservation, ensuring every glass poured at The
      Savoy is perfect.
collaborate_title: Work with Vintage Politics
collaborate_text: We are open to sponsorship, episode partnerships, live events,
  and bespoke collaborations.
hosts_title: Our Hosts
hosts_subtitle: Vintage Politics has been hosted by fabulous venues which share
  our passion for incredible wines. Check them out below.
hosts:
  - name: Hide Restaurant Mayfair
    image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop
    url: https://www.hide.co.uk/
  - name: Quo Vadis
    image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop
    url: https://www.quovadissoho.co.uk/
  - name: Restaurant 1890 by Gordon Ramsay at The Savoy
    image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550966871-3ed3cdb5ed0c?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop
    url: https://www.gordonramsayrestaurants.com/restaurants/restaurant-1890/
---
<div class="flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-teal mb-6 uppercase tracking-wide text-center">{{ hero_title }}</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-ink mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">{{ hero_subtitle }}</p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb-16">
        {% for partner in partners %}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-tan/30 text-center">
            <img src="{{ partner.image }}" alt="{{ partner.name }}" class="w-full h-52 object-cover rounded mb-6 grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition duration-700 ease-in-out" />
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-burgundy uppercase mb-2"><a href="{{ partner.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-rust transition">{{ partner.name }}</a></h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">{{ partner.description }}</p>
            <a href="{{ partner.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block mt-5 text-sm font-bold text-rust uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-teal transition">Visit website &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="bg-cream/50 p-10 rounded-lg border border-tan/50 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-burgundy mb-4 uppercase">{{ collaborate_title }}</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">{{ collaborate_text }}</p>
        <a href="contact.html" class="inline-block bg-teal text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-ink transition">Contact Partnerships</a>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-20">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-teal uppercase tracking-wide mb-4">{{ hosts_title }}</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-ink max-w-3xl mx-auto">{{ hosts_subtitle }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            {% for host in hosts %}
            <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md border border-tan/30 overflow-hidden text-center">
                <img src="{{ host.image }}" alt="{{ host.name }}" class="w-full h-56 object-cover grayscale opacity-80 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition duration-700 ease-in-out" />
                <div class="p-6">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-burgundy uppercase mb-3"><a href="{{ host.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-rust transition">{{ host.name }}</a></h3>
                    <a href="{{ host.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm font-bold text-rust uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-teal transition">Visit website &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>
</div>